# The image is built from the manifest and the sources alone.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!clippy.toml
!src
# Cargo.toml names tests ([[test]]), so their files must exist to parse it.
!tests
!crates
!crates/streamgres-diesel
!crates/streamgres-diesel/**
# A workspace member: its manifest alone lets Cargo load the workspace.
!examples/ticket-desk/Cargo.toml
